	(text_box "R1 must be 1.6 times R2 to achieve output voltage close to 3.3V.\nVfb = 1.257, \nVout = Vfb*(R1 + R2)/R2 = 3.268 V.\nSetting R2 to 1 megaOhm and calculating R1 would result in marginally less current consumption.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 82.55 0)
		(size 57.15 15.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
